  "review_targets": [
    "Receiver and handguard remain black under frontal lighting, with subdued broad highlights that reveal the shell volume.",
    "Hardware may reflect bright environment lights, but no white material is assigned to edge chips or to large grip window walls.",
    "Magazine pressed fields read through geometry and restrained roughness differences, without bright painted outlines.",
    "Polymer and rubber have distinct broad highlights; grain is primarily a close-up effect, invisible as large spots at normal view distance.",
    "Contact polish can be seen locally around controls, cheek rest and gripping surfaces. Visible coating damage remains sparse.",
    "Lens transmission and anti-reflection treatment remain from the source materials; the opaque material sample does not recolor glass."
  ],
  "style_basis": "Docs/FPS/Art/DesignDecisions.md, sections 2 and 5",
  "style_interpretation": "Restrained industrial black/gray, clearly separated coated metal, bare hardware, polymer and rubber; local wear for readability, no broad grime or mirror finish, no project codename markings."
}